      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me out? i need to write a little summary for my civics class about the debates around public health mandates (like vaccine or mask mandates). can u write a quick overview of the main arguments people have on both sides? trying to keep it simple for students.",
      "source": "evaluator"
